'''Phantom Fisher''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water one hour before, during, and after the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Spawning ==
'''Phantom Fisher''' can be fished up from water one hour before, during, and after the [[Spooky Festival]], while the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} is in the {{zone|Village}}. It requires {{Skill|fishing|21}} to be fished up. 

[[Sea Creatures#Spooky|Spooky Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

